<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2076" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ălūta</span></b> , ae,
			f., orig. adj. (sc. pellis) [prob. from
		alumen], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a kind of
				soft leather</i>, prob. <i>prepared by means of
				alum.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: alutae tenuiter confectae, *
				<i><span class="en">Caes.
				B. G. 3, 13</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					7, 35</span></i>
			.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>That which is made of it.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A shoe</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nivea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 3, 271</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					7, 192</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rupta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					12, 26</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A purse</i> or <i>pouch</i>:
			tumidā superbus
			 alutā, <i><span class="en">Juv. 14,
				282</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>A patch put on the face for ornament</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. A. A. 3,
				202</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
